  "description": "■Features\nThis game is a fully voiced Japanese-style visual novel.\nRecommended for\n- People who like visual novel type games.\n- People who like emotionally intense stories.\n- People who like pure love stories.\n\n■Synopsis\n【Chapter of the Red Spider Lily】\nMasahide's dream was to become the Lord that would rule this land.\nBut his dream, along with his ego, was crushed, leaving him without any pride.\nIt was then where a girl named Sahana scolded him for living his life as a mere cog of the government.\nHe enters into a loveless political marriage with Sahana, but that relationship slowly changes them both.\nAs it gradually transforms into a passionate relationship, Masahide decides to pursue a dream he once gave up on.\n\n【Chapter of the Water Lily】\nA man without memories.\nCompletely lost, unable to remember even his name, is saved by a girl named Suirin.\nFor Suirin's sake, he turns his existence around.\nAcross the sea, where the nagidori calls.\nKai's memories lie dormant in the sea.",
